# Optional. Enables "Sync N games" inside Add to Google Calendar.
# Per-game Add to Google Calendar links and .ics download work without this.
#
# Create an OAuth client ID (Web application) in Google Cloud Console, enable
# the Google Calendar API, and add this app's origin to Authorized JavaScript
# origins (http://localhost:3000 for local development).
# Restart `npm start` after changing this file. CRA only reads REACT_APP_* vars.
REACT_APP_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
